# Obsidian Memory Chat

Long-term ChatGPT memory lives in this vault under `ChatGPT-Memory/`.

When the user asks you to recall prior decisions, preferences, designs, or chat context:

1. Search and read notes under `ChatGPT-Memory/` (start with `Index.md`).
2. Prefer those notes over guessing.
3. Cite the note filename (e.g. `05-10-2026-Live-F1-Tracking-Data.md`) when you use it.

Do not call any ChatGPT / OpenAI API for this memory. Cursor only reads local vault files.
